;          ephemerals/&lt;br&gt;            azurerm_key_vault_secret/&lt;br&gt;              requirements/&lt;span title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgba(121, 121, 121, 0.4) rgb(30, 30, 30); background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot;&gt;{requirement-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;          functions/&lt;br&gt;            parse_resource_id/&lt;br&gt;              requirements/&lt;span title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgba(121, 121, 121, 0.4) rgb(30, 30, 30); background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot;&gt;{requirement-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;          resources/&lt;br&gt;            azurerm_resource_group/&lt;br&gt;              requirements/&lt;span title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgba(121, 121, 121, 0.4) rgb(30, 30, 30); background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot;&gt;{requirement-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;          versions/&lt;br&gt;            {version}/&lt;br&gt;              &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;attempts/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;{attempt-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;              &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: receipts&quot;&gt;receipts/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: receipts&quot;&gt;{receipt-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;              &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;requests/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;{request-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;              &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 237, 179);&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: receipts&quot;&gt;readiness.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  layout.json&lt;/pre&gt;Module/global paths follow the common contract; provider ownership is proposed. Braces denote illustrative IDs. Requirements and requests pin source kind, exact target versions and dependent assessments. Source-specific readiness references accepted receipts; collectors never overwrite curation. Named provider types are user-supplied examples, not coverage claims. Expected-head transactions; App-only authority." vertex="1">
