                <mxCell id="RtSwCuXH9fdABtDjKVE_-90" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;" value="END-STATE DESIGN, not current live wiring. Solid nodes name existing factory workflows or data surfaces; dashed amber nodes / connectors mark planned factory integration. Existing components may already implement parts of planned stages. Solid connectors are state/artifact dependencies, not automatic dispatch. The dashed scheduler-to-worker edge is the intended transport, not a current direct call. No manual workflows are shown. Done requires all required CURRENT selection/deployment membership; compute, merge or facts acceptance alone is insufficient. Quality: pass / fail / unchecked / not_applicable. Preserve review, environments, fencing and accepted history; no Terraform/provider/upstream execution." vertex="1">
